      "id": "claim_aeea70dd835c4eb199d04c5437d9f291",
      "statement": "Targeting is explicit and per-call rather than session-level: there is no hidden selected-tab or selected-browser state; browserInstanceId selects one connected extension and tabId selects one tab within it, and omitting tabId falls back to the active foreground tab.",
