      "id": "claim_f1a9e4cd9cf94a8cb98f6428b9646a3c",
      "statement": "list_tabs (ADR 0060) mirrors list_browsers: ListTabsRequestPayload is type 'list_tabs' and the extension replies with TabListResponsePayload or TabListErrorResponsePayload, both typed 'tab_list_response'; TabInfo carries opaque tabId/windowId strings, title, HTTP/HTTPS url, active, and supported flags, and only regular HTTP/HTTPS tabs are listed.",
