      "id": "claim_944ec7b50c3640e09b092fdf4c333a03",
      "statement": "open_tab (ADR 0063) creates a new tab and returns its tabId for immediate targeting; OpenTabRequest is type 'open_tab' with a url validated to an HTTP/HTTPS scheme, OpenTabResult returns tabId/url/title, and OpenTabResponse and OpenTabErrorResponse (with OpenTabErrorCode unsupported_scheme, open_tab_failed, or timeout) are both members of the ExtensionResponse union.",
