    {
      "id": "claim_d43e4de9f92a4093815af2d6e61471a0",
      "statement": "Approval-gated actions carry ApprovalMetadata { actionUUID?, approvalRequest? }; the PerformClickAction, PerformWriteTextAction, PerformSetCheckedAction, PerformSelectOptionsAction, PerformSubmitFormAction, and PerformUploadFileAction interfaces all extend ApprovalMetadata, as do the standalone DownloadFileRequest and FetchResourceRequest, so the metadata rides on each action payload.",
