    {
      "id": "claim_703e4b30f977423187ca69d0d03c3489",
      "statement": "Approval error codes are approval_denied, approval_timeout, approval_unavailable, and approval_origin_changed; ActionResultErrorResponse.error and BatchActionError surface actionUUID when available, and the approval timeout is derived from the local MCP HTTP timeout minus a buffer so Brijio returns a structured approval_timeout before the HTTP server produces a generic timeout.",
