      "id": "claim_4ef114319637498ebff6eb2d4467c378",
      "statement": "Downloads and fetches share DownloadState 'in_progress', 'complete', or 'interrupted'; DownloadInfo (kind 'download', numeric id) and FetchResourceInfo (kind 'fetch', string id, plus a 'streaming' state) are distinguished by kind and both surfaced via DownloadStatusResponse with a capability field of 'full' or 'not_supported'.",
