      "id": "claim_f86714319a6f4594b1b395efe1c3388a",
      "statement": "FetchResource streams through FetchResourceStreamMessage: a fetch_resource_start with fetchId/contentType/totalBytes, repeated fetch_resource_chunk messages, a fetch_resource_complete with sha256/totalBytes, and a fetch_resource_error with optional httpStatus; FetchResourceRequest and DownloadFileRequest both extend ApprovalMetadata and are therefore approval-gated.",
