      "id": "claim_9f8c530d81344b74b816941035dd87f5",
      "statement": "BrijioErrorEnvelope (type 'error') carries a BrijioErrorCode and message, plus an optional browsers array so the relay can return available BrowserPresence with a targeting error; BrijioErrorCode is the cross-layer vocabulary spanning auth, message, targeting, batch, staged-upload, and download/fetch failures.",
