      "id": "claim_be4524950fb346c2b2f6bd65dc5a1821",
      "statement": "packages/shared/src/protocol.ts is the single source of truth for the shared wire shapes (envelope, auth/presence, capabilities, tab identity, approval metadata, staged uploads, download/fetch routing) and servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts is the MCP-side companion that mirrors the relevant types and supplies the envelope builders and parsers used by MCP tool calls, which must stay in lockstep to preserve interoperability.",
